# Emitted by `vue-tsc -b` for tsconfig.node.json, which is a composite
# project and therefore must emit. Nothing reads these — Vite loads
# vite.config.ts directly — but they used to land in the repo root and
# were committed, so every typecheck dirtied the working tree with two
# stale build artifacts. tsconfig.node.json now sends them here instead.
node_modules/.tmp

